# iwidgets4.1.1 :: in-file licence audit
#
# Generated by scripts/make-licenses.ps1 from the sources that actually ship
# in kit.vfs (58 Tcl/Itcl/Itk files swept, every comment run of
# every file examined -- this is a full audit, not a sample). Do not edit by hand.
#
# Classification:
#   own-grant     53 file(s) carry a licence grant in their header, quoted below
#   pointer       1 file(s) point at the package licence file (the default)
#   no-header     4 file(s) have no licence text and fall under the package
#                 licence by its own terms ("unless explicitly disclaimed in individual files")

## 1. In-file licence grants, verbatim

# Detection is mechanical: a header block qualifies if it matches licence-grant
# vocabulary. The most common shape(s) are the package licence itself and are
# named, not reproduced. Hand-verified exceptions (per-module licence FILES that
# the staging step prunes, dual-licensed modules, GPL/CC-BY corner cases) are
# enumerated in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which is the authority; this file is
# the evidence that the sweep covered every shipped source.

